{
  "id": "v1-forge",
  "title": "这也叫兵器",
  "requires": [
    "forge_teacher"
  ],
  "cast": {
    "forge_teacher": {
      "name": "{forge_teacher}"
    }
  },
  "cues": [
    {
      "type": "scene",
      "alt": "器坊的门敞着，炉火映红了半面墙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "kicker": "宗门 · 器坊",
      "text": "这也叫兵器"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "交了差，你路过器坊。门开着，里面很热。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "forge_teacher",
      "text": "站住。你腰上挂的那是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你把刀递过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他用指甲弹了一下刃口。声音是哑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "forge_teacher",
      "text": "这也叫兵器。贺钧发的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是。"
        },
        {
          "label": "（不说话）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "forge_teacher",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "forge_teacher",
      "text": "那边的炉子空着。图纸和石料我借你一份，自己打一把。打坏了算我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "forge_teacher",
      "text": "按规矩，记名弟子不能进这道门。就这一回，别往外说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "done"
    }
  ]
}
